  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_01",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "よし、集中モードにしよう。机の上と頭の中、両方を少しだけ狭くする感じ。",
      "displayText": "Okay, let us switch into focus mode. Like narrowing both the desk and your mind a little.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_02",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "最初の目標は大きくしないで。開始できたら、まず勝ち。",
      "displayText": "Do not make the first goal large. If you can begin, that is already the first win.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "通知、余計なタブ、気になるもの。ひとつ減らせるなら、今減らそう。",
      "displayText": "Notifications, extra tabs, tempting things. If you can remove one, remove it now.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Clear one distraction.",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_clear"
        },
        {
          "label": "Start now.",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_start_now"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_clear",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "いいね。一つ減らすだけで、集中の入口が見えやすくなる。",
      "displayText": "Good. Removing just one thing makes the entrance to focus easier to see.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_04",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "happy",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_start_now",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "その勢い、捕まえよう。準備は最低限でいい。",
      "displayText": "Let us catch that momentum. Minimum preparation is enough.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_04",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_04",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "準備ができたら、私は静かにする。必要になったら呼んで。",
      "displayText": "When you are ready, I will be quiet. Call me if you need me.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    }
  ]
}
